    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1546-a1">

                <pb facs="1250" n="1134" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg1134"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President to Colonel
                            Goethals</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">The White House</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-01-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 23, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I wish you would communicate confidentially and discreetly to Federico Boyd that
                    we of the American Government hope that when President Arosemena leaves he will
                    remain to take his place by virtue of his present office as <hi
                        rendition="#italic">secundo designato</hi> during the six months prior to
                    election. Impress on him that we think that his exercise of the office is needed
                    to steady matters in the Republic and that if he abandons the government at this
                    time it will bring about a situation not favorable to the future prosperity of
                    Panama.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. H. Taft.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
